1 NOTE Predniki in potomci Franceta Prešerna iz rodovnika Petra Hawline. Povezave na vire so resnične, a za video navodila (epizoda 14, Uredi vire) namerno zapisane v različnih neurejenih oblikah; stara povezava SIstory pri Ernestini je zgolj primer mrtve povezave. / France Prešeren's ancestors and descendants from Peter Hawlina's pedigree. The source links are real but written in assorted untidy forms on purpose for the video tutorials (episode 14, Organize sources); the old SIstory link on Ernestina is only an example of a dead link.
